# UI/UX skill (marketing + docs site)

This repo is the **public marketing + docs site** (Next.js / Fumadocs). Visual work must follow **ui-ux-pro-max** plus the persisted website design system — never invent a parallel look or copy `~/ui` OLED console patterns.

## Canonical skill path (only this one)

| What | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Skill | `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md` |
| Search CLI | `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py` |
| Master | `design-system/turbopanel-website/MASTER.md` |
| Page overrides | `design-system/turbopanel-website/pages/<page>.md` (wins over Master) |
| Tokens | `src/app/globals.css` (`--tp-*`) |

Do **not** add a second copy under `.cursor/skills/`. Skills for this site live under `.agents/skills/` only.

## When to use

**Before** marketing pages, heroes, docs chrome/layout theming, typography/color/spacing/motion/CTA work, new marketing components, or visual consistency reviews. Skip pure MDX/content, API/config, or non-visual refactors unless appearance changes.

## Mandatory first steps

From the **website repo root**:

1. Read `design-system/turbopanel-website/MASTER.md`, then `pages/<page>.md` if present (Master/pages win over skill search)
2. Read `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`
3. Search only as a supplemental aid (prefer `python3`):

```bash
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \
  "developer tool devops control plane B2B" --design-system -p "TurboPanel Website"
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<query>" --domain style
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<query>" --stack nextjs
```

4. Reuse marketing primitives (`MarketingPrimaryCta`, `MarketingPageShell`, …); implement with `--tp-*` tokens only

Full contract: `AGENTS.md` → **Marketing & docs UI design (ui-ux-pro-max)**. Do not `--persist --force` Master unless an explicit redesign was requested.
